    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/c2270216da94042470aa4563cb343915.avif?t=1691313792\" /></div><br><br><strong><i>Mona</i></strong> is an immersive third person exploration and puzzle game set on an eerie island filled with fantastic creatures. Explore the world and uncover its secrets to figure out what ancient evil decimated the people who used to live there. It is a unique narrative game whose story is told entirely through exploration, environment and visual storytelling.<br><br>Wishlist now to support the development!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/105cae6ad699fec6075682751f455d77.webp?t=1691313792\" /></div><br><br><strong><i>Mona</i></strong> takes place on a small hand-crafted island filled with history and strange creatures that you'll love to explore ! Enjoy detailed environments without any UI, to fully engage with an astonishing ecosystem.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/61afe0f3e92540707f5dfae9eabd9307.poster.avif?t=1691313792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/61afe0f3e92540707f5dfae9eabd9307.webm?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/61afe0f3e92540707f5dfae9eabd9307.mp4?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/f646fee079db6100b0b0d41511906aea.webp?t=1691313792\" /></div><br><br>But the island has not been left without protection... Solve the puzzles and discover what strange evil took over, ages ago.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/0d67ccddf2f54ffddad596f83ad91b6c.poster.avif?t=1691313792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/0d67ccddf2f54ffddad596f83ad91b6c.webm?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/0d67ccddf2f54ffddad596f83ad91b6c.mp4?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/97aa39da853b3091c85321ffde8b5ba8.webp?t=1691313792\" /></div><br><br>Discover a unique microcosm with its own rules and occult magic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/f42f96275487f648ce82fc6014aaca63.poster.avif?t=1691313792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/f42f96275487f648ce82fc6014aaca63.webm?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/f42f96275487f648ce82fc6014aaca63.mp4?t=1691313792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607190/extras/c68b1cd4d9eb924f1a54b584d1eeb346.webp?t=1691313792\" /></div><br><br><br>Remember the immersive experience by switching to the photography mode whenever you want!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets